Again what did you do with the castle wand? You really need to take time
to rediscover essential scrolls/potions/wands. It's hard to function without
knowing what you have. 

If you have charges on the castle wand, wish up a spellbook of identify.
Then go through your stash and ID everything. Armor up as best you can and
work your way up until you can recover absolutely essential MR and reflection.
You're dead meat in Gehennom without them as you quickly found out.

Good luck. Don't give up. Just walk away from the game for a minute. I put
mine aside a couple of days ago after I blew up my bag of holding. Cursed
wands of cancellation! I had been naming them to keep track, but I missed one.

But I'm in good shape. I had all of my Artifacts out. I have a backup BoH.
I have a stash with most of my spellbooks, scrolls, potions rings and wands 
in it. Most importantly I have out 1 magic marker so I can write more
scrolls and spellbooks if I really need them. Magic resistance and reflection
are still intact and my most important ring (slow digestion) was on my finger.
I lost teleport control sadly, but it wasn't critical yet.

In short a bummer, but recoverable.

BTW I have MMF too. Nasty, nasty monster.

Hang in there. You'll work your way out of it.

